<title>CHINA: Taiwan top Hong Kong air cargo partner in April.</title>
<headline>Taiwan top Hong Kong air cargo partner in April.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taipei was Hong Kong's leading air cargo trading partner for both exports and imports during April, latest statistics from HK's Civil Aviation Department show.</p>
<p>Tokyo Narita was the second busiest export destination, followed by Anchorage.</p>
<p>Frankfurt was again the leading European airport of entry for Hong Kong goods during the month.</p>
<p>Hong Kong's top four import airports were all Asian in April -- Taipei, Bangkok, Narita and Singapore -- followed by Frankfurt, which is served by 11 Boeing 747 freighters a week from Hong Kong, operated jointly by Cathay Pacific and and Lufthansa Cargo.</p>
<p>Hong Kong's top export airport destinations by scheduled operators (in tonnes) in April 1997 compared to March were as follows:</p>
<p>				    March 97     April 97</p>
<p>  TAIPEI			    8,396	  8,715</p>
<p>  TOKYO-NARITA		    8,584	  7,729</p>
<p>  ANCHORAGE			 4,665	  4,948</p>
<p>  SINGAPORE			 4,435	  4,496</p>
<p>  FRANKFURT			 4,553	  4,254</p>
<p>  SEOUL			     3,983	  3,941</p>
<p>  NEW YORK JFK		    3,549	  3,234</p>
<p>  OSAKA-KANSAI		    3,487	  3.012</p>
<p>  BANGKOK			   2,905	  2,507</p>
<p>  LONDON HEATHROW		 1,765	  2,155</p>
<p>  LOS ANGELES		     2,220	  2,154</p>
<p>  DUBAI			     1,582	  1,635</p>
<p>  MANILA			    1,764	  1,617</p>
<p>  AMSTERDAM			 1,627	  1,526</p>
<p>  SHANGHAI			  1,371	  1,385</p>
<p>Hong Kong's top originating, import air cargo airports in April 1997 compared to the previous month:</p>
<p>  TAIPEI			    9,276	  9,431</p>
<p>  BANGKOK			   6,460	  7,036</p>
<p>  TOKYO NARITA		    5,089	  5,049</p>
<p>  SINGAPORE			 5,079	  4,975</p>
<p>  FRANKFURT			 3,995	  3,652</p>
<p>  SEOUL			     3,553	  3,350</p>
<p>  LONDON HEATHROW		 2,132	  2,328</p>
<p>  ANCHORAGE			 2,068	  2,161</p>
<p>  KUALA LUMPUR		    1,828	  2,002</p>
<p>  SYDNEY			    2,063	  1,956</p>
<p>  PARIS CDG			 2,001	  1,938</p>
<p>  OSAKA-KANSAI		    1,708	  1,837</p>
<p>  MELBOURNE			 1,673	  1,642</p>
<p>  KAOHSIUNG			 1,549	  1,521</p>
<p>  MANILA			    1,537	  1,390</p>
